      "message": "I think nfs version 4 is very important, and we must support it. When we had the issue, I also had the fix similar to this, but then when we tested it, the crash happened. That is where I took deeper look into it and figured that we are are trying to remove the fd from lru in both cases, hence we must add them as well.\n\nTo summarize, I have already tested your patch with v4 and indeed it crashes with nfs version 4.\n\nMoreover before the patch https://review.gerrithub.io/c/ffilz/nfs-ganesha/+/1170468, the code was similar to your changes. So this change just revert the https://review.gerrithub.io/c/ffilz/nfs-ganesha/+/1170468 introduced to fix the crash https://github.com/nfs-ganesha/nfs-ganesha/issues/971",
